            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaamugarukamu ati: Ku baraabe banga kuhurira Musa na baanabi, tibarikirizisibwa muntu, n'obu yaakuba ozookire omu bafu.",
          "type": "text",
